{"id":"albania-moto","title":"Albania by adventure motorcycle","who":"Classic route · the Accursed Mountains to the Riviera","when":"May–June and September–October","vehicle":"Adventure or enduro motorcycle, 8–10 days","kind":"moto","color":"#b91c1c","summary":"From Shkodër into the Albanian Alps at Theth, the Komani lake ferry to Valbona, down through the mountains to the Ottoman stone towns of Berat and Gjirokastër, and over the Llogara pass to the Riviera's coves. Dirt tracks, goats, bunkers and a warm welcome.","sources":[{"label":"Motorrad: Albania, turquoise coasts and mountain roads","url":"https://www.motorradonline.de/reise/motorradreise-albanien-tuerkisblaue-kuesten-und-abenteuerliche-bergstrassen/"},{"label":"Albanian Riviera motorcycle guide","url":"https://himara.pages.dev/blog/albanian-riviera-motorcycle-guide"}],"approximate":"A common route; the roads are the router's choice.","km":915,"bbox":[19.4554,39.8749,20.4226,42.417],"stops":[{"name":"Shkodër","place":"Shkodër, Albania","at":[42.0681,19.5121],"text":"Rozafa castle above the lake.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/The_City_and_the_Prokletije_from_the_castle.jpg/500px-The_City_and_the_Prokletije_from_the_castle.jpg","page":"Shkodër","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_City_and_the_Prokletije_from_the_castle.jpg","credit":"Ivan Koev","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Theth","place":"Theth, Albania","at":[42.3947,19.7751],"text":"Up into the Accursed Mountains to a village of stone towers.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Theth_Church_Albania.jpg/500px-Theth_Church_Albania.jpg","page":"Theth","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Theth_Church_Albania.jpg","credit":"peter_h","license":"CC0"}},{"name":"Lake Komani","place":"Koman, Albania","at":[42.0954,19.8115],"text":"A ferry through a fjord-like reservoir (bikes go in summer).","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/